5B2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iryaW3Oesb0Q7kNvwEzPhCw&_nc_oc=Adnc1EQvv0wAYv77f5lmO4HGFjautlbHr4KfuENfdpn58B-iiGOIsLbbo38G5OIqJH8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfypMUHAXmYtSz6pESzPtQ038LVChtxa34VgD_8sXTP3SA&oe=69B402D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n0QptXLoxecQ7kNvwEvnel4&_nc_oc=AdmJ45XISNBR2-LDmMAWlWo_VNHg7hKf4vTRiJ4g7_2X_JqF7lo4xnIwmo8O6TXirgw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy_r6YTW0Tk0wghnFNpbzyYWmA3UCyReQsbubHC92bghg&oe=69B40815"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BDt2VkcNR6sQ7kNvwE0fVY9&_nc_oc=AdnWs1soqZE_OyH1V2Umd18S4cVMApCpE60oWIKvbt_PtJf8YhF72juT6ckbFwtllT4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxKZQxWXPdccTBpi_ef8l3g4hxnY6WhcCgWi5oqbH10TQ&oe=69B41BC2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ta2taXkvaOIQ7kNvwERAnaN&_nc_oc=AdnKr7bfs-r0feZFrhQGxX6oiMYQXsDttbbHeeC3UJ2xgtraRrRXtEmZgadL01Pe_0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzmdz6_owYeKm1_7BeZ7kJ9rA4v82j-EFKn92W-8Jyj-A&oe=69B40244"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dI1kodwoAo4Q7kNvwHW_fWS&_nc_oc=AdlllWh5Y6v148AR1VHAR_TJZmw63zCaui9vrOBSm24WYLZSBYgNx7hWnhbRfWEihNQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy32HU7GfjxQtfsaX0hGXUAi6r5H0uqhGK9q_gCU0QAqQ&oe=69B3FAA2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": 